  "details": "This is somewhat related to https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1878-reduce-excessive-spacing-in-user-profiles since I'm assuming the decision to limit the amount of text in the new profile design resulted from not having enough space to fit things anywhere anymore.\n\nTo keep things short, the new profile bio viewports fit less information on the screen at once, making it extremely painful to read through bios since (con)text quickly scrolls out of view. The previous design using a view more/less button was still better than this new design since it allowed users to fold out the entire bio at once.",
